{"content_hash": "d176cce78ec7b2a7", "version_id": 912, "article_id": 92, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "MOUZ wins IEM Beijing 2026 without losing a match", "title_zh": "MOUZ 一场未输，拿下 IEM 北京 2026 冠军", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/024/041.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589100957915-44c9c9228464?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OHx8bW91eiUyMGllbSUyMG1ham9yfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQxODYzNDR8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by wu yi on Unsplash", "author": "wu yi", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@takeshi2?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/black-and-white-bluetooth-earphones-vsCK6oPj5KY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(92, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(130, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "767cdf81a8f4"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-09", "word_count": 86, "reading_minutes": 0.4, "lead": "The CS2 esports event IEM Beijing 2026 ended on Sunday. MOUZ played very well all week and took home the trophy.", "lead_zh": "《CS2》电竞赛事 IEM 北京 2026 于周日结束。MOUZ 整周表现出色，最终捧起冠军奖杯。", "preview": "In the final, MOUZ beat The MongolZ 3:0. MOUZ won every match at the event, so the team finished with no losses. It was a strong week for th", "preview_zh": "决赛中，MOUZ 以 3:0 击败 The MongolZ。MOUZ 在本届赛事中赢下了每一场比赛，最终以全胜战绩收官。对队员们来说，这是非常强势的一周。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 895, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 33.125, "size_bytes": 199728, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 106, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 34.1, "size_bytes": 205488, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 106, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 35.975, "size_bytes": 216864, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 106, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 31.55, "size_bytes": 190224, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 106, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 33.225, "size_bytes": 200304, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 106, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@fa23f15/content/data/versions/912.json", "paragraphs": ["In the final, MOUZ beat The MongolZ 3:0. MOUZ won every match at the event, so the team finished with no losses. It was a strong week for the players.", "NAVI took third place. They beat BB 2:0 in the third-place match. The Chinese team TYLOO finished in 9th to 12th place.", "Next, BLAST Premier Rivals Hong Kong 2026 starts this week, from 11 to 15 November. Many top CS2 teams will play there. It is the last big test before the PGL Major Singapore 2026."], "paragraphs_zh": ["决赛中，MOUZ 以 3:0 击败 The MongolZ。MOUZ 在本届赛事中赢下了每一场比赛，最终以全胜战绩收官。对队员们来说，这是非常强势的一周。", "NAVI 获得第三名，他们在季军赛中以 2:0 战胜 BB。中国战队 TYLOO 排名第 9 至第 12 位。", "接下来，BLAST Premier Rivals 香港 2026 将于本周开打，时间为 11 月 11 日至 15 日。许多顶尖 CS2 战队都会参赛。这是 PGL Major 新加坡 2026 之前的最后一场重要练兵。"], "body": "In the final, MOUZ beat The MongolZ 3:0. MOUZ won every match at the event, so the team finished with no losses. It was a strong week for the players.\n\nNAVI took third place. They beat BB 2:0 in the third-place match. The Chinese team TYLOO finished in 9th to 12th place.\n\nNext, BLAST Premier Rivals Hong Kong 2026 starts this week, from 11 to 15 November. Many top CS2 teams will play there. It is the last big test before the PGL Major Singapore 2026.", "body_zh": "决赛中，MOUZ 以 3:0 击败 The MongolZ。MOUZ 在本届赛事中赢下了每一场比赛，最终以全胜战绩收官。对队员们来说，这是非常强势的一周。\n\nNAVI 获得第三名，他们在季军赛中以 2:0 战胜 BB。中国战队 TYLOO 排名第 9 至第 12 位。\n\n接下来，BLAST Premier Rivals 香港 2026 将于本周开打，时间为 11 月 11 日至 15 日。许多顶尖 CS2 战队都会参赛。这是 PGL Major 新加坡 2026 之前的最后一场重要练兵。", "text": "In the final, MOUZ beat The MongolZ 3:0. MOUZ won every match at the event, so the team finished with no losses. It was a strong week for the players. NAVI took third place. They beat BB 2:0 in the third-place match. The Chinese team TYLOO finished in 9th to 12th place. Next, BLAST Premier Rivals Hong Kong 2026 starts this week, from 11 to 15 November. Many top CS2 teams will play there. It is the last big test before the PGL Major Singapore 2026.", "vocab": [{"word": "final", "pos": "noun", "zh": "决赛", "note": "the last match of a tournament", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "beat", "pos": "verb", "zh": "击败", "note": "beat / beat / beaten", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "match", "pos": "noun", "zh": "比赛", "note": "a single game between two teams", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "team", "pos": "noun", "zh": "队伍", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "win", "pos": "verb", "zh": "赢得", "note": "win / won / won", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "place", "pos": "noun", "zh": "名次", "note": "third place = 第三名", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "event", "pos": "noun", "zh": "赛事", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "test", "pos": "noun", "zh": "考验、练兵", "note": "a chance to check how good a team is", "phonetic":